🇦🇪 В это воскресенье, 29 ноября, в Дубае пройдёт авиашоу в честь Национального дня ОАЭ

Пилотажная группа Fursan Al Emarat выступит над пляжем Kite Beach с 16:15 до 17:15. Вход свободный.

@dubai_media

🏠 A 10% or 20% down payment? With which option will you pay more in the first year?

Let’s compare two apartments priced at AED 1.5 million each. The price is the same, but the payment schedules differ. The figures are illustrative.

→ 10% down payment. You pay AED 150,000 at booking and another 40% of the purchase price over the course of the year. Your first-year payments total AED 750,000.

→ 20% down payment. You pay AED 300,000 at booking and another 20% of the purchase price over the course of the year. Your first-year payments total AED 600,000.

The full payment schedule determines how much you need to budget and when. If you’re using funds from your business to buy the apartment, check whether any large payments are due when your business needs more working capital.

